  "description": "Reid Comfort 1 | Comfort city bike\nComfortable, relaxed and easy to ride – a versatile comfort bike designed for everyday cycling, city streets, cycle paths and leisurely rides.\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 1 is designed for relaxed, comfortable everyday cycling, with an upright geometry that helps reduce fatigue and an easy-going riding position. Ergonomic handlebars, ergo grips and a comfort saddle add further support for city rides, cycle paths and leisurely weekend rides.\nA Shimano 7-speed Revoshift drivetrain provides simple, reliable gear changes, while lightweight alloy V-brakes offer confident and controlled stopping.\n27.5\" double-wall alloy rims and wide 2.35\" all-terrain tyres provide added cushioning, grip and stability across roads, cycle paths and smoother mixed surfaces.\nWith its relaxed geometry, wide tyres and comfort-focused components, the Reid Comfort 1 is an easy and enjoyable choice for everyday journeys, leisure rides and riders looking for a more comfortable way to cycle.\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 1 is ideal for:\n\nEveryday cycling – a relaxed riding position designed for comfort and ease\n\nCity and urban riding – responsive handling combined with wide 27.5\" tyres for added comfort\n\nLeisurely rides – comfort-focused geometry and components help reduce fatigue.\n\nCycle paths and mixed surfaces – 2.35\" all-terrain tyres provide grip and cushioning across a variety of surfaces\n\nSimple, reliable gearing – Shimano 7-speed Revoshift makes changing gears straightforward and easy to use\n\nComfort-focused riding – ergonomic handlebars, ergo grips and a comfort saddle provide additional support\n\nConfident stopping – lightweight alloy V-brakes offer controlled and reliable braking.\n\nAn upright riding position – relaxed geometry helps create a comfortable and natural riding posture\n\nEveryday errands and weekend rides – a versatile and easy-going bike for getting around town or enjoying more miles at your own pace",
